[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 85 'Paris",
    "start": 0.55,
    "end": 3.972,
    "zh": "第85课《巴黎》",
    "zh_hant": "第85課《巴黎》"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "in the Spring'.",
    "start": 3.772,
    "end": 5.773,
    "zh": "《春天的巴黎》",
    "zh_hant": "《春天的巴黎》"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 6.353,
    "end": 10.575,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "At what time of year did Ken",
    "start": 11.716,
    "end": 14.977,
    "zh": "肯是在一年中的什么时候",
    "zh_hant": "肯是在一年中的什麼時候"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "visit Paris?",
    "start": 14.817,
    "end": 16.398,
    "zh": "去巴黎的？",
    "zh_hant": "去巴黎的？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Hello, Ken.",
    "start": 18.559,
    "end": 19.88,
    "zh": "你好，肯。",
    "zh_hant": "你好，肯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Hi, George.",
    "start": 20.2,
    "end": 21.701,
    "zh": "你好，乔治。",
    "zh_hant": "你好，喬治。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "Have you just been to the cinema?",
    "start": 22.161,
    "end": 24.962,
    "zh": "你刚去过电影院吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你剛去過電影院嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "Yes, I have.",
    "start": 25.183,
    "end": 27.063,
    "zh": "是的，我去过了。",
    "zh_hant": "是的，我去過了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "What's on?",
    "start": 27.544,
    "end": 28.664,
    "zh": "上映什么片子？",
    "zh_hant": "上映什麼片子？"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "'Paris in the Spring'.",
    "start": 29.065,
    "end": 31.946,
    "zh": "《春天的巴黎》。",
    "zh_hant": "《春天的巴黎》。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "Oh, I've already seen it.",
    "start": 31.646,
    "end": 34.387,
    "zh": "哦，我已经看过这部电影了。",
    "zh_hant": "哦，我已經看過這部電影了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "I saw it on television last year.",
    "start": 35.008,
    "end": 38.269,
    "zh": "我去年在电视上看的。",
    "zh_hant": "我去年在電視上看的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "It's an old film, but it's very good.",
    "start": 38.809,
    "end": 42.832,
    "zh": "这是一部老片子，但非常好。",
    "zh_hant": "這是一部老片子，但非常好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "Paris is a beautiful city.",
    "start": 43.333,
    "end": 46.254,
    "zh": "巴黎是一座美丽的城市。",
    "zh_hant": "巴黎是一座美麗的城市。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "I've never been there.",
    "start": 46.975,
    "end": 48.716,
    "zh": "我从未去过那里。",
    "zh_hant": "我從未去過那裡。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "Have you ever been there, Ken?",
    "start": 48.917,
    "end": 51.578,
    "zh": "肯，你曾经去过那里吗？",
    "zh_hant": "肯，你曾經去過那裡嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "Yes, I have.",
    "start": 51.978,
    "end": 53.839,
    "zh": "是的，我去过。",
    "zh_hant": "是的，我去過。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "I was there in April.",
    "start": 54.02,
    "end": 56.241,
    "zh": "我去年四月在那里。",
    "zh_hant": "我去年四月在那裡。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Paris in the spring, eh?",
    "start": 57.262,
    "end": 59.923,
    "zh": "春天的巴黎，是吗？",
    "zh_hant": "春天的巴黎，是嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "It was spring, but the weather was awful.",
    "start": 60.444,
    "end": 64.606,
    "zh": "当时是春天，但天气很糟糕。",
    "zh_hant": "當時是春天，但天氣很糟糕。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "It rained all the time.",
    "start": 64.647,
    "end": 67.328,
    "zh": "一直在下雨。",
    "zh_hant": "一直在下雨。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "Just like London!",
    "start": 67.949,
    "end": 70.13,
    "zh": "就像伦敦一样！",
    "zh_hant": "就像倫敦一樣！"
  }
]
